<p class="figures-title">The distance to the switch-over, where it moved</p>
<ul class="figures">
<li><span class="when">before batch 7</span><span class="val">1.7K</span><span class="note">first measured</span></li>
<li><span class="when">after 7</span><span class="val">940</span><span class="note"></span></li>
<li><span class="when">after 7R</span><span class="val">627</span><span class="note"></span></li>
<li><span class="when">after 7b</span><span class="val">598</span><span class="note"></span></li>
